{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms: The Others is a cooperative horror game for up to 4 players where you will be forced to explore these unknown nooks and crannies, trying to survive in this complex world where death can be waiting for you at every turn! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High complexity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Stealth</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive AI</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incredible design</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Life </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Also for your attention</h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The presence of flickering light, be careful if you have problems with it. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Caution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is unique compared to many others that focus on the backrooms concept. It sets itself apart by not simply copying everything detailed within the community. Instead, it carefully integrates specific elements of the backrooms, providing a distinct perspective rather than mirroring the entire concept.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585080?t=1752229986","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585080?t=1752229986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585080/d54496a3f4d4701262b0b5ebbfc841e6934ace26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752229986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585080/d54496a3f4d4701262b0b5ebbfc841e6934ace26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752229986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"descr